          <ATTRIBUTE_DATA>From the vSphere Web Client go to Administration &gt;&gt; Single Sign-On &gt;&gt; Configuration &gt;&gt; Policies &gt;&gt; Lockout Policy. Click "Edit". Set the Time interval between failures to "900" and click "OK".</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
